      "cooked": "<p>Deadline's Pandemonium Key reads:</p><blockquote><p>The first time an environment target enters play each turn, play the top card of the villian deck.</p></blockquote><p>does this apply when any given envirnomental target enters play or any given type of environmental target?&nbsp; For instance, if The Final Wasteland, if an Amphibious Chupacabra is turned over in two different turns, is that considered one or two targets and therefor two villian card plays?&nbsp;</p><p>The \"The first time\" phrasing is confusing me, but I read it as each one would trigger the villian card play.</p><p>Thanks,<br>Ben</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:18.889Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
